odern drag and drop toolkit for React\\n36|- **📊 Recharts** - Redefined chart library built with React and D3\\n37|- **🖼️ Sharp** - High performance image processing\\n38|\\n39|### 🌍 Internationalization & Utilities\\n40|- **🌍 Next Intl** - Internationalization library for Next.js\\n41|- **📅 Date-fns** - Modern JavaScript date utility library\\n42|- **🪝 ReactUse** - Collection of essential React hooks for modern development\\n43|\\n44|## 🎯 Why This Scaffold?\\n45|\\n46|- **🏎️ Fast Development** - Pre-configured tooling and best practices\\n47|- **🎨 Beautiful UI** - Complete shadcn/ui component library with advanced interactions\\n48|- **🔒 Type Safety** - Full TypeScript configuration with Zod validation\\n49|- **📱 Responsive** - Mobile-first design principles with smooth animations\\n50|- **🗄️ Database Ready** - Prisma ORM configured for rapid backend development\\n51|- **🔐 Auth Included** - NextAuth.js for secure authentication flows\\n52|- **📊 Data Visualization** - Charts, tables, and drag-and-drop functionality\\n53|- **🌍 i18n Ready** - Multi-language support with Next Intl\\n54|- **🚀 Production Ready** - Optimized build and deployment settings\\n55|- **🤖 AI-Friendly** - Structured codebase perfect for AI assistance\\n56|\\n57|## 🚀 Quick Start\\n58|\\n59|```bash\\n60|# Install dependencies\\n61|npm install\\n62|\\n63|# Start development server\\n64|npm run dev\\n65|\\n66|# Build for production\\n67|npm run build\\n68|\\n69|# Start production server\\n70|npm start\\n71|```\\n72|\\n73|Open [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000) to see your application running.\\n74|\\n75|## 🤖 Powered by Z.ai\\n76|\\n77|This scaffold is optimized for use with [Z.ai](https://chat.z.ai) - your AI assistant for:\\n78|\\n79|- **💻 Code Generation** - Generate components, pages, and features instantly\\n80|- **🎨 UI Development** - Create beautiful interfaces with AI assistance  \\n(more lines below)\"}","truncated":false}
