{"record":"parent_entry","position":{"parent_record":"request:00000000000000000051:0000","subposition":null},"original_role":"tool","source":"tool_result","trust":"untrusted","provenance":null,"content":"{\"kind\":\"tool_result\",\"call_id\":\"call_01a169ffca2573b699f2839edb919eab\",\"output\":\"Read text file `Blog, CMS & Community Platforms/blog/README.md`.\\n1|# Modern Blog\\n2|\\n3|A modern blog platform built with Node.js featuring a clean and responsive design.\\n4|\\n5|## Features\\n6|\\n7|- Modern and responsive UI\\n8|- Article filtering by category\\n9|- Search functionality\\n10|- Admin panel for content management\\n11|- Clean and minimalistic design\\n12|\\n13|## Getting Started\\n14|\\n15|1. Install dependencies:\\n16|```bash\\n17|npm install\\n18|```\\n19|\\n20|2. Start the server:\\n21|```bash\\n22|npm start\\n23|```\\n24|\\n25|3. For development with auto-reload:\\n26|```bash\\n27|npm run dev\\n28|```\\n29|\\n30|The server will start on port 8080 by default. You can access the blog at `http://localhost:8080`\\n31|\\n32|## Structure\\n33|\\n34|- `/public` - Static files (HTML, CSS, JavaScript)\\n35|- `/server.js` - Node.js server configuration\\n36|- `/public/css` - Stylesheets\\n37|- `/public/js` - Client-side JavaScript\\n38|- `/public/admin` - Admin panel files\\n39|\\n40|## License\\n41|\\n42|MIT License\"}","truncated":false}
